  <description>
    Iris quadcopter with ArduPilotPlugin on fdm_port_in 9002, for the
    guidance_sim two-vehicle engagement world. Derived from
    ardupilot_gazebo's iris_with_ardupilot; only the model name and the
    FDM port differ, so SITL instance 0 binds to it.
  </description>
</model>
